%!PS

/usertimeStart usertime def

mark
	/CreationDate (D:202608291930)
	/Title (Penrose Tiling)
	/Author (Julian D. A. Wiseman)
	/Subject (https://github.com/jdaw1/penrose_tiling/)
	/Keywords (Penrose tiling rhombi)
